# Synced types copy (read-only for agents)

`apps/functions/packages-local/types/` is **generated**, not source of truth.

- It is overwritten by `scripts/sync-types-into-functions.cjs` on every `firebase deploy` functions predeploy and `npm run sync:functions-types`.
- **Never edit** files under `packages-local/types/` (including `src/index.ts`).
- To change shared types, edit **`packages/types/src/`** only, then run `npm run sync:functions-types` if needed locally.
- Do not “fix” lint in the copy; fix or ignore at the source/sync boundary.
